{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/3e3767a2953711c79fa552fddb8a7cb9.avif?t=1762440458\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SoundBoard is a simple and fun app for anyone who wants to bring more life to calls, streams, and gaming sessions. With just one click, you can play sounds, keeping everything organized in a practical and creative panel full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The SoundBoard library is built by the community: like your favorite sounds, discover new creations, or add your own to collaborate. You can also customize your home screen with unique categories, set shortcuts for every moment, and make your experience truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an intuitive design and focus on simplicity, SoundBoard makes sure you have fun without complications \u2014 whether you\u2019re streaming, chatting with friends, or gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn any moment into something special with SoundBoard \u2014 your personalized sound hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc9c The SoundBoard Team</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914510?t=1762440458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/078d2a211f6eff5932f3319d1913ce84ef1be8c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762440458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/207b5046d2992d8b5e41ea642d8f68a3a938b1dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762440458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/207b5046d2992d8b5e41ea642d8f68a3a938b1dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762440458","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/3e3767a2953711c79fa552fddb8a7cb9.avif?t=1762440458\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SoundBoard is a simple and fun app for anyone who wants to bring more life to calls, streams, and gaming sessions. With just one click, you can play sounds, keeping everything organized in a practical and creative panel full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The SoundBoard library is built by the community: like your favorite sounds, discover new creations, or add your own to collaborate. You can also customize your home screen with unique categories, set shortcuts for every moment, and make your experience truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an intuitive design and focus on simplicity, SoundBoard makes sure you have fun without complications \u2014 whether you\u2019re streaming, chatting with friends, or gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn any moment into something special with SoundBoard \u2014 your personalized sound hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc9c The SoundBoard Team</p>","developers":["Totoya"],"genres":[{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.aka